WEBVTT

01:06.066 --> 01:08.443
ARTIST LEE SA-RA
SUSPICIOUS DRUG-RELATED BEHAVIOR AT CHURCH

01:12.572 --> 01:14.657
SEEMINGLY INTOXICATED
FILMED BY CHURCHGOERS

01:20.997 --> 01:22.207
Take a look at this.

01:22.290 --> 01:23.917
WEATHER FORECASTER A
SCHOOL VIOLENCE

01:24.000 --> 01:26.544
-What the heck?
-Is she insane or what?

01:27.337 --> 01:29.172
-Seriously?
-How could she do that?

01:30.673 --> 01:32.133
CAUGHT USING DRUGS BY CHURCHGOERS

01:36.846 --> 01:38.765
9,411 LIKES

01:40.809 --> 01:42.727
IT'S OBVIOUSLY PARK YEON-JIN
FIENDISH BITCH

01:46.189 --> 01:47.232
OBVIOUSLY PARK YEON-JIN

01:47.315 --> 01:48.441
SR LEE WAS INFAMOUS IN PARIS

01:48.525 --> 01:49.901
OMG PARK YEON-JIN
AW F**K, MY STOCKS

02:10.088 --> 02:12.590
Ms. Lee Sa-ra, this is the police!

02:12.674 --> 02:14.342
Oh fuck!

02:14.425 --> 02:15.260
Ms. Lee?

02:31.025 --> 02:33.027
The whole country is in uproar.

02:34.404 --> 02:35.405
I saw.

02:41.035 --> 02:44.622
Jeez, did you forget that I'm a doctor?
What if it leaves a scar?

02:45.582 --> 02:48.585
I see you've been
dying to put ointment on it.

02:50.170 --> 02:51.754
Wow, look at that.

02:52.422 --> 02:54.257
So you knew.

02:54.340 --> 02:55.842
Jeez, I was worried sick.

02:58.303 --> 02:59.888
Worried sick over a tiny scar?

02:59.971 --> 03:02.473
Yeah, I am. So what?
Are you going to sue me?

03:04.934 --> 03:06.060
Did you treat it right?

03:06.144 --> 03:08.646
Ha! You're the one who left it untreated.

03:11.441 --> 03:13.276
I was embarrassed, that's why.

03:14.944 --> 03:17.197
Did my mother call you again?

03:18.156 --> 03:20.491
This wasn't supposed to end like this.

03:20.575 --> 03:24.287
This story was supposed to have
a really heartwarming ending, you know.

03:24.787 --> 03:27.790
You haven't had breakfast yet?
I'll cook.

03:28.291 --> 03:29.709
Don't mess up a nice day.

03:29.792 --> 03:31.294
Is my cooking that bad?

03:31.377 --> 03:33.046
So you know.

03:33.129 --> 03:36.883
When it rains, this house feels
like a huge effervescent vitamin.

03:36.966 --> 03:40.261
Don't change the subject.
Hey, hands off the pan.

03:45.225 --> 03:48.645
She showed up soaking wet.
She was shivering. She's asleep now.

03:49.229 --> 03:51.314
But her mother can't come right now.

03:51.397 --> 03:53.066
So I was worried.

04:05.912 --> 04:06.746
Get up.

04:08.998 --> 04:10.416
What are you doing here?

04:17.090 --> 04:18.758
I had nowhere to go.

04:20.760 --> 04:23.513
Did you see what's online too?

04:25.974 --> 04:27.892
How could I not? Everyone at work saw it.

04:33.356 --> 04:34.816
Do you want to leave me?

04:37.527 --> 04:39.112
Let's deal with what's at hand.

04:39.696 --> 04:41.364
We'll go to the office now.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.408
The lawyers are on their way.

04:45.994 --> 04:47.078
Thanks, Do-yeong.

04:47.161 --> 04:49.414
No need to thank me.
It's the logical step.

04:50.915 --> 04:52.917
I'm protecting my stocks
for the company.

04:54.544 --> 04:57.005
Deciding if I should leave you
is last on my list.

05:10.810 --> 05:16.316
Are you the person referred to as A
in the online post?

05:17.150 --> 05:20.820
Do you happen to know
who might have written this?

05:21.821 --> 05:24.324
Please point out the facts in this post.

05:29.871 --> 05:31.664
Is there proof that this is me?

05:33.499 --> 05:35.001
If there's no proof,

05:37.045 --> 05:38.212
then it's not me, right?

05:39.922 --> 05:42.508
Are you saying
that this post is not about you?

05:42.592 --> 05:44.093
What does it sound like to you?

05:45.845 --> 05:48.848
If we react to this,
we'll be advertising it everywhere.

05:49.515 --> 05:51.434
Not taking action is the right answer.

05:53.436 --> 05:57.106
I know the masses better than you do.

06:04.530 --> 06:06.783
You just need to get through 48 hours.

06:06.866 --> 06:10.078
You can do the urine and hair test
after the warrant comes out.

06:10.745 --> 06:14.082
Even if you get a sentence,
first offenders get put on probation.

06:14.165 --> 06:16.417
So just keep your mouth shut, all right?

06:16.501 --> 06:17.668
I know!

06:18.628 --> 06:20.129
I'm the victim, Dad.

06:20.213 --> 06:22.173
The rights to my likeness were violated.

06:22.256 --> 06:26.260
So you should get four or five lawyers
instead of just one or two.

06:26.344 --> 06:28.679
What the hell can you do with these two?

06:33.309 --> 06:36.145
Ms. Lee, it's time for your test.
Please provide your urine.

06:36.229 --> 06:37.563
Do you have a warrant?

06:38.314 --> 06:40.400
No, you don't.
This was an emergency arrest.

06:42.485 --> 06:45.238
You've done a lot of studying
for a first offender.

06:47.031 --> 06:49.450
Get lost,
you low-level civil servant bitch.

06:54.831 --> 06:57.500
I thought you weren't coming
after rushing me so much.

06:58.000 --> 07:00.711
Well, you never know
what's going to happen in life.

07:01.212 --> 07:02.463
Let me see what you got.

07:05.425 --> 07:06.926
Nothing was erased.

07:07.427 --> 07:08.928
There's nothing to be examined.

07:09.011 --> 07:10.555
This hard drive is completely new.

07:11.139 --> 07:14.934
What the hell are you on about?
I've been using it for over four years.

07:15.017 --> 07:16.602
Maybe someone swapped it, then.

07:17.103 --> 07:19.939
You can find it if it was erased,
but not if it was swapped.

07:20.523 --> 07:21.691
What is it, anyway?

07:25.111 --> 07:27.447
Where are you? Are you free today?

07:27.530 --> 07:29.282
This isn't about Yeon-jin or Sa-ra.

07:29.782 --> 07:32.285
I found out something about Myeong-o.

07:33.703 --> 07:34.996
You know that asshole, Jae-jun?

07:36.038 --> 07:39.125
I drive him around,
have conversations with him,

07:39.208 --> 07:41.586
drink with him,
be a friend to him.

07:41.669 --> 07:44.922
I bet you know this too.
That I only graduated from high school,

07:45.006 --> 07:48.426
but I'm basically a college graduate
because I took classes for him.

07:48.509 --> 07:52.346
So it hurts my fucking pride
to be called a driver.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.682
Get to the point. You're pissing me off.

07:54.765 --> 07:57.935
Sounds like Myeong-o's threatening
Yeon-jin, right?

07:58.519 --> 08:00.855
If I were him,
I would have spent my time better

08:00.938 --> 08:04.025
and become a director
at Jaepyeong Construction

08:04.108 --> 08:05.610
instead of fucking with you.

08:08.279 --> 08:09.113
What's wrong?

08:09.197 --> 08:11.616
That's where it ends.
The recording must have stopped.

08:11.699 --> 08:13.868
Play it from the very beginning again.

08:14.452 --> 08:15.912
He just talks about drinks.

08:21.834 --> 08:23.085
"Pommar… D"?

08:25.630 --> 08:26.797
What the hell?

08:31.177 --> 08:32.678
"Sauvi…"

08:32.762 --> 08:34.514
Fuck, I can't even read this.

08:36.599 --> 08:37.892
Which is most expensive?

08:37.975 --> 08:40.394
I'd be pissed off if I drink a cheap one.

08:41.854 --> 08:43.189
Fuck, whatever.

08:44.982 --> 08:46.150
All right.

08:46.234 --> 08:47.902
If you don't know, play it safe.

08:52.698 --> 08:55.701
Pommard, Sauvignon, Almaviva.

08:56.452 --> 08:57.286
Which one?

08:57.787 --> 09:00.790
I'm meeting with Do-yeong for dinner.

09:06.546 --> 09:07.713
Why?

09:12.802 --> 09:14.220
What is it?

09:15.221 --> 09:17.723
No way.
Did that asshole take your booze too?

09:18.224 --> 09:21.269
Did you let anybody else listen to this?

09:22.311 --> 09:24.480
No, you're the first one.

09:28.109 --> 09:29.777
Can you raise an eight-year-old kid?

09:31.737 --> 09:32.905
Just like that?

09:34.532 --> 09:35.366
Whose kid?

09:39.829 --> 09:40.663
Mine.

09:45.084 --> 09:46.002
You have a kid?

09:48.754 --> 09:49.672
Yeah.

09:50.631 --> 09:52.049
But she's at Yeon-jin's place.

09:52.633 --> 09:54.135
What are you talking about?

09:55.970 --> 09:57.972
Are you talking about Ye-sol? Ha Ye-sol?

09:58.055 --> 09:59.348
It's Jeon Ye-sol.

10:01.434 --> 10:03.811
What? You don't want to?

10:08.983 --> 10:11.485
That's a unique way to propose to someone.

10:13.321 --> 10:15.489
There's no other option, is there?

10:16.157 --> 10:19.577
Of course we should bring her here.
She's your child.

10:20.995 --> 10:21.996
Want to join me?

10:59.325 --> 11:02.578
You're a real son of a bitch, you know?

11:03.162 --> 11:04.163
I know.

11:06.499 --> 11:09.335
Are you making kimchi?
You're a bit late this year.

11:09.919 --> 11:12.171
Yeah. I've been a bit busy recently.

11:12.254 --> 11:13.255
Oh yeah?

11:16.676 --> 11:18.260
MS. MOON

11:19.720 --> 11:23.724
June 16th, 1987. 1:10 a.m. Yoon So-hee.

11:23.808 --> 11:26.310
That's 43,800 won.

11:27.186 --> 11:29.522
But hey, are you wearing makeup?

11:30.231 --> 11:32.566
Oh, is it too red?

11:32.650 --> 11:33.901
My goodness!

11:34.652 --> 11:37.655
My husband has decided to become better.

11:38.239 --> 11:42.243
He said he'll stop drinking and work hard,
so I'm going to trust him.

11:42.326 --> 11:43.994
Really?

11:44.078 --> 11:47.498
Wow, I'm so happy for you!

11:48.124 --> 11:49.792
He only buys on credit,

11:49.875 --> 11:52.461
but he's still a customer,
so I was getting worried

11:52.545 --> 11:54.296
after he stopped showing up.

11:55.381 --> 11:58.884
By the way,
why haven't I seen Sun-a these days?

11:59.552 --> 12:00.803
She's with my mother.

12:02.012 --> 12:03.514
Is it because of her father?

12:04.765 --> 12:06.684
Yeah, that's for the best.

12:09.645 --> 12:11.063
That's 1,000 won too much.

12:11.939 --> 12:13.774
Then I'll just take this too.

12:13.858 --> 12:16.861
Oh, you don't have to do that!

12:16.944 --> 12:19.238
You look pretty!
You should wear makeup every day!

12:19.321 --> 12:20.990
Oh, you're embarrassing me!

12:21.073 --> 12:22.575
Thank you!

12:46.891 --> 12:48.225
Hey, Gyeong-ran.

12:48.309 --> 12:52.021
-How long you gonna cry for? All night?
-Stop weeping, you fucking bitch.

12:56.275 --> 12:57.443
Gyeong-ran.

12:57.526 --> 13:00.196
Scream again,
and I'll shove this in your mouth.

13:01.071 --> 13:02.615
What is she doing here?

13:05.451 --> 13:07.870
She must be nuts.
She came here by choice?

13:21.884 --> 13:23.719
You recognized me

13:23.803 --> 13:28.057
when I first met with Myeong-o
at Siesta, didn't you?

13:30.059 --> 13:32.478
Alcohol, water, or coffee.
Which one do you want?

13:35.815 --> 13:36.649
Coffee.

13:41.487 --> 13:43.447
Why didn't you tell Yeon-jin though?

13:44.448 --> 13:45.282
Should I have?

13:46.867 --> 13:49.787
Just get to the point. Why are you here?

13:49.870 --> 13:51.497
That post about So-hee.

13:52.498 --> 13:53.415
You saw it, right?

13:55.251 --> 13:57.920
We both know who the perpetrator was.

14:00.464 --> 14:01.882
After So-hee, it was me.

14:02.925 --> 14:04.677
-And after that--
-Shut up!

14:09.098 --> 14:10.099
So what?

14:11.141 --> 14:12.476
You want me to testify?

14:13.060 --> 14:15.855
No. I came here to ask you
to not do anything.

14:17.398 --> 14:19.149
I've been watching Siesta for a while.

14:19.233 --> 14:21.777
That's how I know
that you used to live there.

14:23.779 --> 14:27.867
But, on October 20th, you moved
from Siesta to this small room.

14:27.950 --> 14:31.537
That's when Yeon-jin stopped
having her outfit fittings there.

14:32.246 --> 14:35.583
And Son Myeong-o also disappeared
around that time.

14:37.960 --> 14:39.670
He doesn't deserve to live anyway.

14:42.131 --> 14:44.049
And why are you talking to me about this?

14:44.800 --> 14:46.719
Because I think you already know

14:47.845 --> 14:49.013
that Son Myeong-o's dead.

14:53.976 --> 14:57.980
This is our last chance
to save ourselves from our past.

14:59.231 --> 15:00.316
So don't interfere.

15:01.901 --> 15:04.403
No matter what you saw, know, or heard,

15:06.238 --> 15:07.656
just don't do anything.

15:08.991 --> 15:10.826
The person who killed Myeong-o

15:12.077 --> 15:13.746
has to be Park Yeon-jin,

15:14.663 --> 15:15.581
Gyeong-ran.

15:26.300 --> 15:28.969
-Jong-heon!
-Wow, awesome!

15:29.595 --> 15:31.847
Wow, Director Joo!

15:32.932 --> 15:34.099
Damn!

15:36.018 --> 15:38.854
Why do you need a career certificate
when you have this place?

15:38.938 --> 15:39.939
You owe me a meal.

15:40.439 --> 15:41.523
I'm applying for a job.

15:42.024 --> 15:43.567
CAREER CERTIFICATE

15:44.860 --> 15:46.612
Let's go. What do you want to eat?

15:46.695 --> 15:48.447
You crazy bastard. Beef, of course!

15:48.530 --> 15:51.450
Oh, I've heard that a lot recently.

15:52.743 --> 15:55.037
Were there any letters
sent to the hospital?

15:55.120 --> 15:56.956
There was an address I couldn't change.

15:57.456 --> 15:59.875
Jeez, you should've brought them along.

16:00.876 --> 16:01.794
Those letters

16:02.962 --> 16:05.297
don't come anymore.
The director found out.

16:07.716 --> 16:08.884
So Mom found out.

16:09.885 --> 16:11.428
I should've been more careful.

16:13.722 --> 16:14.974
Keep this between us, okay?

16:15.057 --> 16:16.392
Seriously, what is it?

16:17.017 --> 16:19.186
What is it?
You have to at least tell me something.

16:19.269 --> 16:22.523
Later, okay?
I swear I'll tell you everything later.

16:23.023 --> 16:24.358
Still like day drinking?

16:24.441 --> 16:25.609
After you, old chap.

16:27.653 --> 16:29.488
-Cheers!
-Cheers! Yes!

16:33.742 --> 16:36.996
Day drinking in Semyeong is the best.
Here, let me mix one for you.

16:37.079 --> 16:38.122
Okay, all right.

17:21.540 --> 17:22.541
We meet again.

17:24.126 --> 17:25.044
Yeah.

18:06.585 --> 18:07.419
What?

18:08.837 --> 18:12.925
Does my playing style…
remind you of someone?

18:18.013 --> 18:20.724
That player's good at attaching
and bending the stones.

18:21.600 --> 18:23.602
They're also calm and quiet.

18:25.646 --> 18:27.648
You end up following them mindlessly,

18:29.525 --> 18:31.860
and before you realize it,
your house has fallen apart.

18:38.367 --> 18:40.369
I learned to play Go from my father.

18:41.161 --> 18:43.080
And that's exactly the way I taught it

18:43.664 --> 18:44.706
to Dong-eun.

18:46.125 --> 18:48.043
She said she wanted to beat somebody.

18:52.422 --> 18:54.091
Are you helping with her revenge?

18:55.801 --> 18:57.136
I have no reason to stop her.

18:57.928 --> 18:59.096
I don't understand.

19:00.305 --> 19:01.140
Which part?

19:01.932 --> 19:05.269
I don't know what you mean to each other,
but if you care about her,

19:06.186 --> 19:07.855
shouldn't you try to stop her?

19:08.772 --> 19:12.192
Being obsessed with something
that can't be changed seems like a loss

19:13.443 --> 19:15.279
compared to the fruits of revenge.

19:22.578 --> 19:24.997
Among the things that victims have lost,

19:26.540 --> 19:29.543
how many things
do you think they can reclaim?

19:34.131 --> 19:38.010
It's just their own glory and honor.
Nothing more.

19:40.721 --> 19:43.307
Some regain those things
through forgiveness,

19:44.016 --> 19:46.185
while others regain them through revenge.

19:48.353 --> 19:50.564
Only then can they reach
the starting point.

19:52.691 --> 19:56.195
That's when Dong-eun's life
as a 19-year-old will finally start.

20:03.202 --> 20:06.205
And I'm helping Dong-eun
reach that starting point.

20:06.997 --> 20:08.248
She's just trying…

20:10.792 --> 20:13.670
to be a bit less miserable
than she is right now.

20:18.383 --> 20:20.594
I don't know
how you interpreted what I said.

20:23.555 --> 20:25.891
But I also want her to be happy.

20:28.310 --> 20:29.228
I can…

20:32.397 --> 20:33.482
relate to that.

20:38.612 --> 20:40.113
I told you that's not Yeon-jin.

20:40.197 --> 20:41.865
You know what tabloids are like.

20:42.574 --> 20:44.243
I'm driving. Hang up.

21:01.677 --> 21:02.761
She just

21:04.263 --> 21:05.764
recognized me.

21:15.440 --> 21:16.358
That prick

21:16.942 --> 21:19.278
knows where I live?

21:24.866 --> 21:25.742
NEW MESSAGE

21:26.576 --> 21:30.080
It looks like your daughter killed
two people, not just one.

21:30.580 --> 21:32.457
It was good seeing you, by the way.

21:39.298 --> 21:40.132
Two?

21:44.344 --> 21:45.887
MOM

21:48.515 --> 21:51.351
Kim Bu-seong from Daily Post.
Are you Ms. Park Yeon-jin?

21:51.435 --> 21:52.602
Did you see the post?

21:52.686 --> 21:54.730
Some are saying that you are this "A."

21:54.813 --> 21:55.897
It's not me.

21:55.981 --> 21:59.443
-Is that your official statement?
-Will Jaepyeong release a statement?

21:59.526 --> 22:01.445
Didn't you graduate from Sunghan High?

22:01.528 --> 22:03.655
Did you see the video of Lee Sa-ra?

22:03.739 --> 22:05.073
-A comment, please!
-Come on!

22:05.157 --> 22:07.075
-Can you tell us anything?
-Excuse me!

22:07.159 --> 22:08.410
Please say…

22:30.807 --> 22:32.100
Do you have proof?

22:33.560 --> 22:34.603
Proof.

22:34.686 --> 22:35.896
Do you have it?

22:37.272 --> 22:38.857
You have no idea.

23:05.634 --> 23:06.635
What are you doing?

23:13.392 --> 23:15.644
Jae-jun just called and asked

23:15.727 --> 23:18.230
who changed the hard drive
for the security camera.

23:19.564 --> 23:21.817
I think he took it to be examined.

23:24.611 --> 23:27.030
You want to change the hard drive?

23:27.114 --> 23:29.199
Don't make me repeat myself.

23:29.282 --> 23:31.493
I dropped by for a bit yesterday,

23:31.576 --> 23:33.412
and Do-yeong might be visiting soon.

23:34.955 --> 23:37.165
I heard changing it
is better than erasing it.

23:38.417 --> 23:40.335
You know how meticulous Do-yeong can be.

23:42.087 --> 23:43.255
I wouldn't know.

23:44.631 --> 23:45.882
Well, I just told you.

23:45.966 --> 23:47.843
And don't say a thing to Jae-jun.

23:49.511 --> 23:50.345
Okay.

23:56.893 --> 23:59.646
The security cam footage is gone,
time has passed,

23:59.729 --> 24:01.481
and the body has been buried.

24:01.565 --> 24:03.650
There's no way that Chief Shin will talk.

24:04.192 --> 24:07.863
No matter what you heard,
you can't prove anything, Dong-eun.

24:07.946 --> 24:09.698
What should I say to Jae-jun?

24:10.532 --> 24:12.617
Say that I'm the one who changed it.

24:14.703 --> 24:17.873
Let's do fittings here again.
Bring my clothes, starting tomorrow.

24:27.883 --> 24:29.050
Ms. Kang Hyun-a.

24:31.970 --> 24:35.807
June 16th, 1987.

24:36.641 --> 24:40.479
Oh, what a life.

24:40.562 --> 24:43.565
Everything is so unfamiliar and strange.

24:44.191 --> 24:47.194
It's like a tiny boat floating
on an endless ocean.

24:47.277 --> 24:48.445
How sad.

24:50.363 --> 24:54.117
Yes. There had been serious bullying
from a young age.

24:54.201 --> 24:57.496
I need to unravel it.
I need to unravel a destiny like this.

24:57.579 --> 25:00.081
This isn't your destiny though.
Whose is it?

25:02.959 --> 25:05.545
So, you can't really see all that stuff?

25:07.964 --> 25:11.259
The General wants me to throw out
the smirky woman who talks back to him.

25:11.343 --> 25:14.137
Yoon So-hee.
She's the owner of this destiny.

25:16.014 --> 25:18.517
Her name is Yoon So-hee,
and she was born in 1987.

25:18.600 --> 25:21.520
Please do what you can.

25:25.774 --> 25:29.611
Oh dear!

25:29.694 --> 25:32.864
So tough. It's so tough!

25:32.948 --> 25:36.618
Your job is awful,
and your family gives you trouble.

25:37.369 --> 25:40.205
Be careful with documents this year.
You might get scammed.

25:41.790 --> 25:44.209
Wow, you're so good.

25:45.126 --> 25:49.047
He wants to do it.
The General wants to perform a ritual.

25:49.130 --> 25:53.218
He wants a very, very special ritual.

25:55.637 --> 25:58.974
The ritual will have to be very special.
Would you be okay with that?

25:59.558 --> 26:00.642
Of course.

26:00.725 --> 26:03.645
If it can unravel her destiny,
I'll do it a hundred times.

26:04.145 --> 26:06.398
Please do a special one.
A very special one.

26:15.740 --> 26:16.741
Oh, I'm sorry!

26:17.909 --> 26:19.494
No need to help me. Just go.

26:19.578 --> 26:20.704
What an annoying day!

26:20.787 --> 26:22.330
PERSONAL INFORMATION
LEE SEOK-JAE

26:35.176 --> 26:38.013
-Isn't this the one I read for you before?
-It is.

26:38.096 --> 26:39.681
I want you to read his face too.

26:40.181 --> 26:42.559
Does this prick really have a short life?

26:44.019 --> 26:46.021
-Who is he, anyway?
-Ma'am.

26:47.022 --> 26:50.859
Why don't you do a ritual with me?
You just have to give this asshole a call.

26:51.359 --> 26:53.361
I need to go pray. Go now.

26:54.321 --> 26:56.781
I know that I'm not as powerful
as I used to be,

26:56.865 --> 26:58.575
but I'll get punished for this.

26:58.658 --> 27:00.535
You haven't been punished until now.

27:01.536 --> 27:03.830
Think about all the girls
that you pimped out,

27:03.913 --> 27:05.332
using their destinies as bait.

27:05.415 --> 27:06.583
How dare you!

27:06.666 --> 27:08.668
So just hear me out.

27:09.461 --> 27:12.213
You have to build
a massive sanctum, don't you?

27:12.922 --> 27:16.509
This prick wants a billion won from me.

27:16.593 --> 27:18.261
Right now, I'm asking you

27:18.762 --> 27:22.182
if I should give the billion to you
or this asshole.

27:23.099 --> 27:24.225
He'll die soon, right?

27:25.310 --> 27:27.646
A… billion?

27:36.613 --> 27:38.073
BITCH WHO'LL END UP IN A DITCH

27:44.079 --> 27:45.330
Yes, ma'am.

27:45.413 --> 27:46.998
What's Hye-jeong up to?

27:47.082 --> 27:48.917
She's been blanking all my calls.

27:49.417 --> 27:50.835
Oh, right.

27:50.919 --> 27:53.588
That lady is staying
at that fellow's place.

27:54.172 --> 27:55.715
"That lady"? "That fellow"?

27:56.591 --> 28:00.679
Right. Choi Hye-jeong has been staying
at Jeon Jae-jun's place for a few days.

28:00.762 --> 28:02.597
She leaves for work from his place too.

28:02.681 --> 28:03.640
From where?!

28:03.723 --> 28:04.557
GROOM-TO-BE

28:04.974 --> 28:05.975
Tae-uk.

28:06.059 --> 28:09.145
I've been thinking, and I feel like
I'm not good enough for you.

28:09.229 --> 28:13.400
Thanks for everything. I sent the ring
to you using express delivery.

28:13.483 --> 28:16.319
I hope you'll meet someone better than me,
and be happy.

28:16.945 --> 28:19.197
BLOCK CONTACT

28:26.496 --> 28:27.414
Jun?

28:38.508 --> 28:39.759
So you're actually here.

28:41.553 --> 28:43.221
Yeah, why?

28:43.847 --> 28:46.683
I'm dating Jae-jun.
We started dating two days ago.

28:46.766 --> 28:48.101
Sure. Congratulations.

28:49.310 --> 28:53.314
Why did you tell me to go
to that plastic surgeon?

28:54.482 --> 28:56.067
Joo Yeo-jeong Plastic Surgery.

28:57.819 --> 29:00.405
Did you know that he's the son
of Joo Hospital's director?

29:01.948 --> 29:04.200
He's the son of Joo Hospital's director?

29:07.328 --> 29:09.914
Oh, right. His last name is Joo.

29:11.458 --> 29:13.710
How did he get involved
with Dong-eun, then?

29:15.170 --> 29:17.756
Are you seriously asking me that?

29:19.174 --> 29:22.010
You got involved with her too.
So you should know, bitch.

29:23.845 --> 29:26.014
She told you to call me there, didn't she?

29:28.099 --> 29:29.934
What else did she tell you to do?

29:31.853 --> 29:32.937
You know,

29:34.105 --> 29:36.357
you seem like you have a lot of free time.

29:37.275 --> 29:39.527
Did you come all the way here
just to ask me that?

29:40.695 --> 29:43.364
When everybody's talking about you
on the Internet?

29:46.451 --> 29:48.453
-Are you out of your mind?
-Why?

29:49.287 --> 29:51.414
Do I need your permission to act this way?

29:52.415 --> 29:55.001
You have no idea
what I might have in my pocket.

29:55.084 --> 29:55.919
Know your place.

29:59.339 --> 30:00.173
My place?

30:00.256 --> 30:02.258
Jae-jun's not answering your calls, is he?

30:04.427 --> 30:06.429
Stop being so arrogant, Yeon-jin.

30:07.347 --> 30:10.099
It isn't just a coincidence
that you can't reach him.

30:16.981 --> 30:18.817
I bought him this shirt.

30:20.026 --> 30:21.194
Keep that in mind.

30:29.577 --> 30:31.329
You can take it. Happy now?

30:35.667 --> 30:37.502
Your boob job looks great as always.

30:47.303 --> 30:48.888
JONGNO POLICE STATION

30:48.972 --> 30:49.931
Give me a hair tie.

30:50.515 --> 30:51.516
Here.

30:51.599 --> 30:53.017
Ugh, fuck.

30:53.560 --> 30:54.811
My head is freaking itchy!

30:55.395 --> 30:58.106
Look at you,
sitting in there with your blond hair.

30:58.189 --> 30:59.774
It's like an American TV show.

31:00.358 --> 31:01.860
You look great behind bars.

31:02.443 --> 31:03.945
Having fun? Are you?

31:04.863 --> 31:06.030
Where are the others?

31:06.990 --> 31:08.825
They're not coming, of course.

31:08.908 --> 31:11.411
-Especially not Yeon-jin.
-What's up with Yeon-jin?

31:12.203 --> 31:13.288
You don't know?

31:14.581 --> 31:17.250
Oh, I guess
you were busy getting arrested.

31:17.333 --> 31:20.128
Cut to the chase, damn it.
What are you talking about?

31:20.211 --> 31:22.964
Yeon-jin's bullying got exposed,
but it got totally buried,

31:23.047 --> 31:24.465
thanks to your drug story.

31:25.466 --> 31:26.384
Today,

31:26.467 --> 31:29.971
they released an article accusing you
of tax evasion through art exhibitions.

31:32.098 --> 31:34.475
Isn't it too perfect
for it to be a coincidence?

31:35.184 --> 31:37.604
It's as if she used you
to bury her story on purpose.

31:43.860 --> 31:46.487
Hello, can we take pictures
of the exhibition pieces?

31:46.571 --> 31:48.156
It'll only take a moment, okay?

31:51.159 --> 31:52.035
Get out, quickly.

31:56.706 --> 31:59.959
I saw your text late.
Here's the general management fee.

32:02.170 --> 32:03.838
I thought you ran away.

32:04.714 --> 32:08.468
I only saw your mother at your apartment.
I heard a loud noise two days ago.

32:12.597 --> 32:16.434
Before, when my mother came by,

32:17.226 --> 32:19.979
why did you tell her
that I didn't live there?

32:24.317 --> 32:27.070
You should have someone on your side too.

32:30.073 --> 32:32.075
Family issues, they are tough.

32:32.158 --> 32:34.577
They say that families
are matched by the heavens.

32:35.078 --> 32:39.791
Still, you shouldn't try to shoulder
all of that burden by yourself.

32:41.542 --> 32:44.712
Even the heavens
must make mistakes sometimes.

32:46.631 --> 32:48.633
And don't be late next month.

33:36.597 --> 33:38.683
SENDER: KANG YEONG-CHEON
CHEONGSONG PRISON

33:38.766 --> 33:41.185
RECIPIENT: JOO YEO-JEONG
SEOUL JOO GENERAL HOSPITAL

33:43.312 --> 33:44.605
CHEONGSONG PRISON

33:54.866 --> 33:57.660
CHEONGSONG PRISON

33:57.744 --> 33:58.828
MEDICAL OFFICER KIM JIN-HUN

34:01.205 --> 34:02.040
You crazy bastard.

34:02.123 --> 34:03.541
How long has it been?

34:05.001 --> 34:07.503
We met when I was a medical officer,
so three years.

34:07.587 --> 34:08.588
Salute.

34:09.297 --> 34:10.298
Have you been well?

34:10.381 --> 34:13.801
Do I look like I'm doing well?
I'm always dealing with scary guys.

34:14.719 --> 34:17.972
But you're the scariest guy
that I've seen this year.

34:21.893 --> 34:23.144
Give me the papers.

34:23.895 --> 34:25.563
The papers are perfect,

34:26.522 --> 34:29.108
but it might need a little nudge from you.

34:30.818 --> 34:32.528
When I first saw you,

34:32.612 --> 34:34.947
I figured life would be
like a convenience store for you.

34:35.531 --> 34:38.076
I thought it'd be nice,
being able to buy houses and cars

34:38.159 --> 34:40.161
like buying
banana-flavored milk at a store.

34:41.662 --> 34:42.997
So when a guy like you…

34:44.582 --> 34:47.210
I was so surprised
when I got your call, you know that?

34:48.086 --> 34:51.839
I'm thankful that you heard me out.
When are you leaving the country?

34:52.340 --> 34:55.176
After they pick my successor,
and I help with the handover.

34:57.512 --> 34:59.514
Your papers might get rejected.

35:00.264 --> 35:03.851
I heard it's up to the warden,
and that this place is short of staff.

35:04.811 --> 35:07.063
That case was so infamous, you know.

35:08.064 --> 35:09.607
The warden must know about it.

35:10.358 --> 35:13.694
That's why it has to be me.
I'd be continuing my father's work.

35:14.278 --> 35:15.279
Joo Yeo-jeong?

35:17.615 --> 35:18.783
Doctor?

35:36.968 --> 35:40.471
Even now, what happened that day
is as vivid as yesterday in my memory.

35:41.806 --> 35:44.308
The scent of blood in my nostrils.

35:45.351 --> 35:49.772
The cutting noises that the knife made
when it pierced his neck.

35:50.731 --> 35:53.317
The temperature of the blood
that ran down my hands.

35:54.986 --> 35:57.905
And even his last, flickering gaze.

36:02.160 --> 36:03.744
I knew you'd recognize me.

36:07.373 --> 36:09.167
I was hurt that you never wrote back.

36:11.919 --> 36:13.337
How could I forget you?

36:14.922 --> 36:17.758
My life is a living hell,
thanks to you, Mr. Kang.

36:20.761 --> 36:23.014
I knew it. I knew you'd recognize me.

36:28.186 --> 36:29.604
This place is nice and all,

36:30.521 --> 36:31.856
but it's so boring, Doctor.

36:44.285 --> 36:45.536
I have a question.

36:49.582 --> 36:50.583
Why did you do it?

36:52.627 --> 36:56.130
You said you remember everything vividly,
like it happened just yesterday.

36:57.632 --> 36:59.967
Why did you kill the man who saved you?

37:00.718 --> 37:01.719
How could you…

37:04.055 --> 37:05.556
do that as a human being?

37:18.069 --> 37:20.571
I'm having so much fun today.

37:25.243 --> 37:26.577
I'll see you again, won't I?

37:31.457 --> 37:33.459
Inmate 3724, back away from the fence!

37:34.335 --> 37:37.004
Conversing with visitors is not allowed.
Please back away.

37:43.761 --> 37:45.012
Yeah, I'll see you again.

37:46.764 --> 37:48.015
Next time I see you,

37:49.558 --> 37:51.560
I'll show you the hell that I'm living in.

37:52.687 --> 37:54.021
And the time after that,

37:55.690 --> 37:58.192
I'll show you the hell
that you'll be living in.

37:59.777 --> 38:01.195
Until then, please…

38:04.031 --> 38:04.865
be well.

38:29.056 --> 38:31.058
We don't have time for coffee.

38:31.559 --> 38:35.104
The shaman said it'll only be effective
if we do it at the set time.

38:37.148 --> 38:38.149
Dry your hair.

38:38.941 --> 38:40.318
What are you doing?

38:43.738 --> 38:45.072
What's your dream?

38:46.365 --> 38:47.199
What?

38:47.283 --> 38:48.451
Whatever it is,

38:49.493 --> 38:51.329
leave me out of it from now on.

38:51.829 --> 38:53.247
Buy a new phone too.

38:56.792 --> 38:57.793
Mister!

38:57.877 --> 38:59.128
NAMYANGJU LOTTERY STORE

38:59.211 --> 39:01.714
Didn't you see an effect
because I blocked the bad energy for you?

39:01.797 --> 39:02.631
Yeah, what?

39:07.428 --> 39:08.429
I'm on my way.

39:10.431 --> 39:12.183
You didn't block shit.

39:13.726 --> 39:15.811
The funeral home was sold?

39:16.604 --> 39:17.438
When? To whom?

39:17.521 --> 39:19.899
Oh, I have no idea.

39:20.566 --> 39:22.485
I only got notified about it.

39:23.527 --> 39:26.947
Anyway, about that corpse.
You should probably take care of it soon.

39:33.371 --> 39:34.872
Never thought I'd be saying this.

39:36.123 --> 39:37.541
How's business nowadays?

39:38.334 --> 39:40.336
-Getting a lot of customers?
-What?

39:43.881 --> 39:45.216
Oh, yeah.

39:45.299 --> 39:46.967
Thanks to you.

39:47.760 --> 39:49.011
Thank you for your concern.

39:49.095 --> 39:50.429
Yeah.

39:51.222 --> 39:52.848
That's all you have to say.

39:54.517 --> 39:56.018
Did you say anything to anyone?

39:56.519 --> 39:59.105
My God, then I'd get in trouble too!

40:02.733 --> 40:04.485
I told him what you wanted me to.

40:04.568 --> 40:07.196
I said, "I'll be working
until the end of this month,

40:07.279 --> 40:08.572
so get rid of that thing."

40:08.656 --> 40:12.076
All right. Good work.
Call me when you get their schedule.

40:44.358 --> 40:46.110
Which recipe did you look at?

40:46.694 --> 40:48.696
The one at the very top
when I looked it up.

40:48.779 --> 40:50.281
Unbelievable.

41:05.421 --> 41:06.589
Where did you go today?

41:09.133 --> 41:10.134
A place far away.

41:12.511 --> 41:13.679
Let me look at the cut.

41:20.936 --> 41:22.104
If we met each other

41:23.397 --> 41:26.734
in a different way,
in a different situation,

41:28.402 --> 41:30.070
would things have been different?

41:34.325 --> 41:35.493
It'd be the same.

41:37.161 --> 41:40.581
I would have fallen for you,
no matter what you were like.

41:42.333 --> 41:43.417
I'm 99% sure.

41:45.252 --> 41:46.837
Why are you leaving out 1%?

41:48.756 --> 41:50.341
Because it's 100% now.

41:57.848 --> 41:59.058
It healed perfectly.

42:15.199 --> 42:16.867
I'm holding you hostage.

42:18.369 --> 42:20.037
Say that the noodles were good.

42:24.250 --> 42:28.087
If you force me like this,
there's no way it can't taste good.

43:09.962 --> 43:11.880
Ms. Moon, where are you going?

43:13.090 --> 43:14.091
Ye-sol.

43:16.093 --> 43:19.930
If you tell me to, I'll apologize to you

43:20.681 --> 43:21.932
until the day I die.

43:23.309 --> 43:24.476
Why?

43:26.020 --> 43:27.605
Because I truly

43:29.273 --> 43:30.441
am sorry to you.

43:34.194 --> 43:35.195
Goodbye.

44:05.476 --> 44:08.145
Congratulations, Mom.
You got what you wanted.

44:08.979 --> 44:10.397
I quit my job at the school.

44:10.898 --> 44:13.067
I'm on my way now,
so get out of my apartment.

44:18.656 --> 44:19.740
Ms. Park Yeon-jin.

44:20.240 --> 44:21.533
I'm not doing interviews.

44:22.034 --> 44:23.035
I'm from the police.

44:31.835 --> 44:33.337
You're a hard person to pin down.

44:33.879 --> 44:37.091
You check your texts,
but you never pick up my calls.

44:38.300 --> 44:39.551
What brings you here?

44:39.635 --> 44:42.429
Where were you
on the night of October 19th?

44:44.765 --> 44:46.100
A cop came to talk to me.

44:46.183 --> 44:48.102
He asked me what I did on October 19th.

44:48.185 --> 44:49.019
HONG YEONG-AE

44:49.103 --> 44:51.772
I told him I was doing a broadcast,
but what should I do now?

44:52.481 --> 44:54.566
Did you know about the investigation?

44:54.650 --> 44:57.653
You didn't even check, did you?
Can't you stop the investigation?

44:59.697 --> 45:00.531
No.

45:01.949 --> 45:02.783
I can't stop it.

45:06.120 --> 45:07.788
What do you think you're doing?

45:08.372 --> 45:09.248
Are you done?

45:10.541 --> 45:12.543
Can I talk about myself today, then?

45:15.462 --> 45:16.755
I'm going to retire.

45:17.965 --> 45:20.551
I want to move to a warm country
and play golf.

45:20.634 --> 45:22.636
Everyone is going to Hawaii nowadays.

45:24.805 --> 45:27.933
You're going to retire
in the middle of this shitshow?

45:28.016 --> 45:29.351
Because it's a shitshow,

45:30.310 --> 45:32.438
maybe I could do it
with someone else's money.

45:40.571 --> 45:41.905
Why should I leave?

45:42.906 --> 45:44.575
I'm not leaving!

45:45.075 --> 45:49.204
Go on and try all you want!

45:49.705 --> 45:51.206
Why did you quit your job?

45:51.707 --> 45:56.295
You could have made a fortune
if you held out for a bit!

45:56.378 --> 46:01.717
Yeah, a girl like you
could never be a teacher.

46:01.800 --> 46:04.052
Good job, you bitch!

46:04.845 --> 46:06.764
Just now, too,

46:06.847 --> 46:09.266
that was my boyfriend.

46:09.892 --> 46:14.480
How dare you stare at him like that,
you fucking bitch?

46:14.563 --> 46:18.817
Oh, he only left because he's a nice guy.

46:18.901 --> 46:21.069
If it were anybody else,

46:21.153 --> 46:24.114
you would've been slapped in the face!

46:25.073 --> 46:27.409
I shouldn't have given birth to you.

46:27.910 --> 46:30.704
Everybody else told me to get an abortion,

46:31.330 --> 46:33.499
but I cherished those 9 months
and gave birth.

46:34.082 --> 46:36.960
I did my best raising you.

46:38.128 --> 46:39.463
Well, I'm sorry!

46:39.963 --> 46:41.131
Sorry!

46:42.758 --> 46:46.595
I've made a terrible mistake!

46:48.680 --> 46:52.893
You're the one who ended
our relationship for money.

46:52.976 --> 46:53.811
Get out!

46:53.894 --> 46:57.022
Oh, you fucking bitch!

46:58.148 --> 46:59.233
You're so…

47:01.819 --> 47:03.570
Stab me. Kill me!

47:04.363 --> 47:07.783
That's the only way left
for you to cling onto me now.

47:21.088 --> 47:25.092
You're scared of that fire, aren't you?

47:26.593 --> 47:28.846
Why don't you buy me a house in Hawaii,

47:29.680 --> 47:32.015
and give me a handsome amount of cash too?

47:33.433 --> 47:37.521
I feel like it's a shame that I'm retiring
before I reach my retirement age.

47:41.066 --> 47:43.902
What makes you think
that I would do that for you?

47:46.446 --> 47:47.948
Because I haven't buried

47:49.116 --> 47:50.617
Son Myeong-o's body yet.

47:53.745 --> 47:54.997
What?

47:55.080 --> 47:58.166
An unidentified body has been found
at 71-1 Sunghan-dong, Jongno-gu.

47:58.250 --> 47:59.084
Let's go.

47:59.167 --> 48:01.837
I repeat, unidentified body found.
Officers needed.

48:01.920 --> 48:03.589
Unit One is en route.

48:32.910 --> 48:34.745
I'll never forgive you.

48:41.710 --> 48:42.961
REASON FOR WITHDRAWAL: MALADJUSTMENT

48:43.045 --> 48:45.589
The reason I won't forgive you

48:47.424 --> 48:49.593
is because you still don't understand

48:50.469 --> 48:53.055
that you were my first perpetrator.

48:57.768 --> 49:00.771
So stop laughing.

49:01.772 --> 49:03.440
Stop laughing like that!

49:04.608 --> 49:07.277
And what can you do if I keep laughing?

49:08.362 --> 49:09.446
All right!

49:10.030 --> 49:11.448
The two of us can just

49:11.949 --> 49:16.536
burn to death together today,
then, can't we?!

49:17.245 --> 49:18.956
Eat this, you bitch!

49:36.723 --> 49:38.308
Say that you're sorry.

49:40.060 --> 49:44.648
Beg for forgiveness! Now!

49:54.241 --> 49:55.742
Thank you, Mom.

49:56.994 --> 49:58.412
Thanks for not changing.

50:01.206 --> 50:02.708
For staying the same.

50:04.668 --> 50:06.586
Thank you so much!

52:10.710 --> 52:15.507
Subtitle translation by: Daham Yoon
